Error: Jet.SwitchOffAsExpression: `#On` does not produce a value
  --> Tests/UI/E0343_on_switch_attribute_as_expression.jet:4:12
    |
  4 |     value: #On(.Deep) 1
    |            ^^^
 Why: Statement switch attributes control a whole statement; expressions must still produce values in every build
 Fix: Put it before the statement: `#On(.Deep) <statement>`
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.SwitchOffAsExpression
